\par
In response to queries by Commissioner Scott, Utilities Financial Services Division Director Linda Benoit related that, due to the hurricanes, $5 million of the initial agreement amount of $5.7 million has already been utilized for repairs; and that the change order will allow the County to continue to conduct service and repairs; whereupon, responding to queries by Chair Eggers, Ms. Benoit, with input from Mr. Burton, confirmed that funding for the change order is being taken from operating and capital funds, which are regularly budgeted.\cf1\f1\fs22\par
}

