\par
In response to a query by Commissioner Flowers, Attorney White discussed the County\rquote s interest in maintaining consistency of the ECL; whereupon, Public Works Director Kelli Hammer Levy explained that the ECL was established as a single continuous line encompassing multiple communities; that vacating a portion would negate the entire line and impact the federal beach nourishment project; and that an ECL is required to proceed with beach nourishment in Florida.\cf1\f1\fs22\par
